## SQ-VTD8-02b | remainderBuffer = false: 3 batches eject exactly 3 bottles after the delay, none in slot 9
shell awk '/^[[:space:]]*\[/{s=$0} s ~ /^[[:space:]]*\[vintage\.pickling_jar\][[:space:]]*$/ && /^[[:space:]]*remainderBuffer[[:space:]]*=[[:space:]]*false/{f=1} END{exit !f}' config/creativedelight-common.toml
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> setblock {S5H1+30} {S5H2} {S5H3+28} vintagedelight:fermenting_jar
> data merge block {S5H1+30} {S5H2} {S5H3+28} {inventory:{Size:10,Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"veggiesdelight:garlic_clove",Count:12b},{Slot:1b,id:"minecraft:honey_bottle",Count:3b}]}}
